--- new mutants the single-path design invites ---------------------------------
  M5  noTurnProbe stamps nowIso (round 1's `at` bug)        all  exit 1  BITES  4 FAILs
        FAIL b4 run2: previously-skipped pair heads the (non-control) queue
        FAIL b4 virgin: the pair a fresh record never touched heads run2's queue
